{"ref":"BDB, שִׁמְעוֹן","hw":"שִׁמְעוֹן","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">שִׁמְעוֹן</span></big><sub>44</sub>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong>cf. n.pr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שמעון</span> in Palm. Lzb <sup>378</sup>; meaning doubtful; RS al. cp. <span dir=\"rtl\">سِمْعٌ</span>, said to mean <em>offspring of hyena and wolf;</em> v. Hogg<sup>EB iv. 4531</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  second son of Jacob and Leah, Συμεων: <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:33\" href=\"/Genesis.29.33\">Gn 29:33</a> (name expl. from <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׁמַע</span>), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:23\" href=\"/Genesis.35.23\">35:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 1:2\" href=\"/Exodus.1.2\">Ex 1:2</a> + 14 times (assoc. especially with Levi <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:25\" href=\"/Genesis.34.25\">Gn 34:25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:30\" href=\"/Genesis.34.30\">30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:5\" href=\"/Genesis.49.5\">49:5</a>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  tribal name <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:3\" href=\"/Judges.1.3\">Ju 1:3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:17\" href=\"/Judges.1.17\">17</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:6\" href=\"/Numbers.1.6\">Nu 1:6</a> +; so <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:22\" href=\"/Numbers.1.22\">Nu 1:22</a> + 7 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַטֵּה שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 1:23\" href=\"/Numbers.1.23\">Nu 1:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 2:12\" href=\"/Numbers.2.12\">2:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:5\" href=\"/Numbers.13.5\">13:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַטֵּה בְנֵי שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 10:19\" href=\"/Numbers.10.19\">10:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 34:20\" href=\"/Numbers.34.20\">34:20</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:1\" href=\"/Joshua.19.1\">Jos 19:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:8\" href=\"/Joshua.19.8\">8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:9\" href=\"/Joshua.21.9\">21:9</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:50\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.50\">1 Ch 6:50</a>.<br>†<strong>3.</strong>  post-ex.. Jew with foreign wife <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:31\" href=\"/Ezra.10.31\">Ezr 10:31</a>.","next":"BDB, שִׁמְעוֹנִי","prev":"BDB, שַׁמּוּעַ"}